    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents an animal growth model based on statistical approaches. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the growth of animals using statistical models rather than deterministic curves. It is used for species where growth is influenced by probabilistic factors and variability among individuals. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
